lines=['# Held-out full-arm risk planning: terminal outcome','','All64 requests completed on the frozen8-task cohort; no exception or timeout occurred. Conventional final-only CVaR correction increased classical admission from3/8 to6/8 at5% risk, and4/8 to6/8 at10%. Both ordinary MPD and MPD+the same correction admitted0/8 at both budgets. No selected accepted plan had audited point risk or lower95% bound above its requested budget. This is conditional simulated evidence, not a safety guarantee.','','## Frozen cohort and benchmark','','Source official validation positions128:384:256 examined,207 eligible,8 selected by the prespecified nominal clearance ranks[0,.02,.1,.25,.4,.55,.75,.95]. Exact ordered IDs:1959097,572764,1412961,1930902,1635282,990634,693071,42576. Reference clearances:2.935,6.732,13.308,17.105,18.700,21.574,31.536,73.729mm. All source IDs, exclusions and nominal checks are in TASK_SELECTION.json. No stochastic filtering, replacement cohort, obstacle changes or noise/controller tuning occurred. Cached reference paths served only as task descriptors and were never planner initializers.','','All arms use24 free seven-joint controls, degree5 spline with tripled start/end controls,200 velocity commands over10s. Endpoint joints remain free; goal is the fixed prescribed panda_hand pose within1cm/2deg. Classical proposals use two fresh full-pose DLS seeds, then80 nominal trajectory steps each. MPD uses the genuine frozen checkpoint with two fresh unguided DDIM15 draws. Initialization/generation time is charged every time; no historical proposals are scored as new output.','','The phase6 controller/physics/geometry is unchanged: perfect joint position observed every50ms; nominal feedforward minus2/s tracking error; physical initial offset. Main regime is the prespecified **doubled** synthetic noise:4mrad initial,2mrad/s persistent bias,10mrad/s step velocity noise. No encoder bias/delay, actuator saturation, dynamics/contact simulation or measured hardware accuracy is modeled. Requested commands equal applied commands; nominal requested-command violations and sampled command/executed-velocity failures reject. Both native world/self configurations, joint limits and terminal pose are hard events on5ms grid; sphere coverage and continuous-time safety are not proved. The native scene has10 fixed spheres, no table.','','Common physical cost J=dt sum(u_nom²)+.005dt sum((du_nom/dt)²). This is nominal kinematic effort/smoothness, not torque energy. Both CVaR arms apply exactly the same final-only routine:32 shared physical draws, exact fractional tail at Delta=.05/.10, full5ms maximum signed normalized world/self/joint/command/executed/pose loss,lambda500, normalized buffer.05,8 Adam steps at.003 and gradient norm clip20. Metres/radians are normalized by fixed.01m/.02rad/.1rad/s/goal tolerances; zero preserves the failure sign. Return the lowest-cost sampled-feasible completed iterate, otherwise minimum sampled CVaR. Finite empirical CVaR is not a chance certificate.','','Nominal classical refinement uses50ms geometry and averaged squared penalties; CVaR correction uses5ms trajectory maxima. This distinction, additional iterations and additional compute limit attribution of gains uniquely to stochastic risk. The4-arm design does not include a same-compute deterministic final-correction ablation. It does isolate the same final risk correction on classical versus diffusion proposals.','','## Independent admission, all proposals and selected audits','','Fresh1,024-draw admission for each of two candidates uses exact one-sided beta upper bound at alpha=.05/2. The minimum-cost admitted candidate is selected. Optimization, admission and audit seeds are entirely separate; common draws couple method comparisons. Every proposal is audited on2,048 independent draws; a selected plan gets4,096 draws from the same prespecified audit stream. All-proposal aggregates use the same2,048 prefix even for selected plans. Audits never select, repair or change admission. Confidence is per fixed candidate batch/request, not a simultaneous guarantee across the whole study.','','The requested4,096/8,192 pair was not feasible for all128 proposals under the cap: profiling5.36/10.73s already exceeds the total allowance before optimization. Fixed sample sizes were frozen before main results. Exact duplicate task/trajectory/samplecount audit reuse is reported; every fresh generation/refinement and every admission is charged. Audits are timed separately from request decisions.','','|Budget|Arm|Accepted/8|All-proposal risk|Accepted audited risk|Mean request|','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
